    {
      "source": "Processing of Spring Advisors follows the rules established in\n<a href=\"../../framework/autoproxy/AbstractAdvisorAutoProxyCreator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework.autoproxy\"><code>AbstractAdvisorAutoProxyCreator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "Spring Advisors 的处理遵循在 <a href=\"../../framework/autoproxy/AbstractAdvisorAutoProxyCreator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework.autoproxy\"><code>AbstractAdvisorAutoProxyCreator</code></a> 中建立的规则。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If no &lt;aop:include&gt; elements were used then \"includePatterns\" will be\n<code>null</code> and all beans are included. If \"includePatterns\" is non-null,\nthen one of the patterns must match.",
      "translation": "如果未使用任何 `<aop:include>` 元素，则 `includePatterns` 将为 `<code>null</code>`，所有 Bean 都会被包含。如果 `includePatterns` 不为空，则必须有一个模式匹配。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Any AspectJ annotated classes will automatically be recognized, and their\nadvice applied if Spring AOP's proxy-based model is capable of applying it.\nThis covers method execution joinpoints.",
      "translation": "任何带有 AspectJ 注解的类都将被自动识别，如果 Spring AOP 基于代理的模型能够应用其建议，则这些建议将被应用。这涵盖了方法执行连接点。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the &lt;aop:include&gt; element is used, only @AspectJ beans with names matched by\nan include pattern will be considered as defining aspects to use for Spring auto-proxying.",
      "translation": "如果使用了`<aop:include>`元素，则只有名称与包含模式匹配的@AspectJ  bean 才会被视为用于 Spring 自动代理的切面。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Default is to consider all @AspectJ beans as eligible.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，所有@AspectJ bean 均被视为合格。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation considers Advices, Advisors and\nAopInfrastructureBeans as infrastructure classes.",
      "translation": "默认实现将 Advice、Advisor 和 AopInfrastructureBeans 视为基础设施类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"../../framework/autoproxy/AbstractAdvisorAutoProxyCreator.html#findCandidateAdvisors()\">AbstractAdvisorAutoProxyCreator</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从类复制：<code><a href=\"../../framework/autoproxy/AbstractAdvisorAutoProxyCreator.html#findCandidateAdvisors()\">AbstractAdvisorAutoProxyCreator</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"../../framework/autoproxy/AbstractAutoProxyCreator.html#isInfrastructureClass(java.lang.Class)\">AbstractAutoProxyCreator</a></code></span>",
